{"id":"0fe21798-f55c-4919-84c6-be1b7a4d480b","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"2652ab10856a64ed","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/source-control/extension.ts","baseline":{"blob":"49f40b53c4a75548758e4c9524a7da4b3cf32628","start":2045,"end":2216},"shape":{"type":"ObjectElement","atoms":["\"","command","\"",":","{","\"","command","\"",":","\"","vscode.diff","\"",",","\"","title","\"",":","\"","Open Changes","\"",",","\"","arguments","\"",":","[","resourceUri",".","with","(","{","\"","scheme","\"",":","HEAD_SCHEME","}",")",",","resourceUri",",","change",".","path","+","\""," (Working Tree)","\"","]","}",","]},"context":{"before":"dc34aba5f33e535d","after":"703b468e07d8b6f3"}},"payload":{"text":"Clicking a change opens the diff (HEAD ↔ working tree), the standard SCM gesture.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:57:30.800Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:57:30.800Z"}
{"id":"33700f71-d38b-4c6e-87a1-b2cac8cdadfd","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"f8ebe9b695068710","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/source-control/extension.ts","baseline":{"blob":"942e86d1e29dd73117b8592f92c97b5d3e553a36","start":912,"end":942},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","HEAD_SCHEME","=","\"","git-head","\""]},"context":{"before":"a4ffce90c45e9dcb","after":"cf85db09b817ca64"}},"payload":{"text":"A read-only scheme serving each file's HEAD version, for the gutters and the diff editor.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:57:33.815Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:57:33.815Z"}
{"id":"4039532f-5a2d-4340-883f-fb16077dadea","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"007d467f882f260a","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/source-control/extension.ts","baseline":{"blob":"cb013bca0c9bcbce2f1756aea1d95fab64530e2e","start":1150,"end":1171},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","RETRY_MS","=","2000"]},"context":{"before":"cf85db09b817ca64","after":"d148b8c3009516ec"}},"payload":{"text":"Until the editor's git answers the first time (it starts after this extension can), how often to ask again.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:57:31.822Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:57:31.822Z"}
{"id":"44cdc63d-4125-44ff-bae1-65f1f0332c86","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"f66a766cd4820eec","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/source-control/extension.ts","baseline":{"blob":"01dff67435660e4b5a280e826cdab42e8b75f463","start":3609,"end":3661},"shape":{"type":"MemberExpression","atoms":["vscode",".","workspace",".","registerTextDocumentContentProvider"]},"context":{"before":"2f9774fefa9349fd","after":"929a1bbe553ec6fe#3"}},"payload":{"text":"The HEAD side of a file, for the diff editor and the gutters.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:57:27.429Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:57:27.429Z"}
{"id":"74e11e9c-0d69-4651-a242-9221a24fca64","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"1dd11584a6dd6476","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/source-control/extension.ts","baseline":{"blob":"9fc90ea4abb62020cd5651184a7b107647264ddc","start":0,"end":67},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","GitFileChange","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/editor-api/git","\""]},"context":{"after":"f2517b5f32f25ee8"}},"payload":{"text":"VS Code's Source Control view for the workspace's git: its staged and unstaged changes, the HEAD side of each for the\ndiff editor and the gutters, and commit-all from the input box. (A change that's formatting or comments only is marked\nby the cosmetic extension, over any git.)\n\nGit is the editor's (git-engine.ts, isomorphic-git on the shared workspace, behind git-service.ts — the shell's review\npanel reads it too); this is its VS Code face, through the commands the editor documents (ARCHITECTURE.md, *Extension points* 3):\n`editor.git.status`, `editor.git.file`, `editor.git.commit`. It learns of a change as VS Code's own git does: a save, or\na file watcher — the repository is files too. A browser build's: a desktop build has git of its own.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:57:34.798Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:57:34.798Z"}
{"id":"7a95d967-e251-4df6-a002-6de0de6edab0","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"703b468e07d8b6f3","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/source-control/extension.ts","baseline":{"blob":"ab0d39110bb71e79969fa1cb08dfbc95af580a03","start":2308,"end":2391},"shape":{"type":"Property","atoms":["\"","decorations","\"",":","{","\"","strikeThrough","\"",":","change",".","status","===","\"","D","\"",",","\"","tooltip","\"",":","change",".","status","}"]},"context":{"before":"2652ab10856a64ed","after":"8d7443e1be84a210"}},"payload":{"text":"(whether it's cosmetic is the cosmetic extension's, a file decoration of its own)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:57:29.732Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:57:29.732Z"}
